    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<p>Any Bahmni configuration can be overridden by creating a separate override file. That way, an implementation with multiple entities can have a standard master configuration and each entity will have the freedom to override specific parts</p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27459635/mergeConfig%20(1).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443102854328&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=577\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27459635/mergeConfig%20(1).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443102854328&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"29229102\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"mergeConfig (1).png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27459635\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"4366fb33-877d-4572-98c4-24d7b6aafb4d\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27459635/mergeConfig%20(1).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443102854328&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=661&amp;height=764 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27459635/mergeConfig%20(1).png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443102854328&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=577 1x\"></span></p><h2 id=\"OverridingConfiguration-Example\"><span>Example</span></h2><p>Let us take an example config file:</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"fb679193-7eab-475b-b707-e9330748df03\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>clinical/app.json</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical&quot;,\n        &quot;extensionPoints&quot;: [\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bahmni Clinical Consultation Page&quot;\n            },\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.conceptSetGroup.*&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Define conceptsets part of a conceptset group&quot;\n            },\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.orders&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bahmni Orders Page&quot;\n            },\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;:&quot;org.bahmni.patient.search&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bahmni Patient search, lookups Page&quot;\n            }\n        ],\n}</pre>\n</div></div><p>To override this config file with another file, do the following two things</p><ol><li><p>Add the flag &quot;shouldOverRideConfig: true&quot; as shown below</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"415592a0-4bfc-49d2-b690-472689da9297\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>/var/www/bahmni_config/openmrs/apps/clinical/app.json</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical&quot;,\n\t\t&quot;shouldOverRideConfig&quot;: true,\n        &quot;extensionPoints&quot;: [\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bahmni Clinical Consultation Page&quot;\n            },\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.conceptSetGroup.*&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Define conceptsets part of a conceptset group&quot;\n            },\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.orders&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bahmni Orders Page&quot;\n            },\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;:&quot;org.bahmni.patient.search&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bahmni Patient search, lookups Page&quot;\n            }\n        ],\n}</pre>\n</div></div></li><li><p>Create a new file openmrs/apps/clinical/app.json in the folder /var/www/implementation_config as shown below</p><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"30479801-3951-4934-8716-b955b8e47117\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeHeader panelHeader pdl\" style=\"border-bottom-width: 1px;\"><b>/var/www/implementation_config/openmrs/apps/clinical/app.json</b></div><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: true; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">{\n        &quot;id&quot;: &quot;bahmni.clinical&quot;,\n        &quot;extensionPoints&quot;: [\n            {\n                &quot;id&quot;: &quot;org.bahmni.clinical.consultation.board&quot;,\n                &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Bahmni Clinical Consultation Page&quot;\n            }\n        ],\n}</pre>\n</div></div><p><br/>The above file will override the section &quot;extensionPoints&quot; in the the app.json file with the contents of the app.json file.</p></li><li>Make sure to have an alias for implementation_config is added to &quot;ssl.conf&quot; under /etc/httpd/conf.d directory. Ideally this will be coming from bahmni installer itself. If not, add a new line with &quot;Alias /implementation_config /var/www/implementation_config&quot; where all the aliases are added.</li></ol><h2 id=\"OverridingConfiguration-Differenttypesofoverrides\"><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Different types of overrides</span></h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table class=\"wrapped confluenceTable\"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th class=\"confluenceTh\">Type</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">config</th><th class=\"confluenceTh\">overridden config</th><th colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTh\">Notes</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">override</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"1d22ab34-5cc0-466d-8acc-eebe7822ecec\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">sections: {\n  &quot;observations&quot; : {\n    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;Observations&quot;,\n    &quot;showDefault&quot;:true\n  },\n  &quot;disposition&quot;:{\n   &quot;name&quot;: &quot;disposition&quot;\n   }\n}</pre>\n</div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"c88a4e2f-d815-4ec5-879a-7cb3ae73d451\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">sections: {\n  &quot;observations&quot; : {\n    &quot;showDefault&quot;:false\n  }\n}</pre>\n</div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><ul><li>&quot;observations&quot;.&quot;name&quot; will not be modified</li><li>&quot;observations&quot;.&quot;showDefault&quot; will be overridden</li><li>&quot;disposition&quot; section will be KEPT</li></ul></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\">Remove</td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"b9fb348d-1fa7-4581-a511-bd8e7233283c\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">sections: {\n  &quot;observations&quot; : {\n    &quot;name&quot; : &quot;Observations&quot;,\n    &quot;showDefault&quot;:true\n  },\n  &quot;disposition&quot;:{\n   &quot;name&quot;: &quot;disposition&quot;\n   }\n}</pre>\n</div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><div class=\"content-wrapper\"><div class=\"code panel pdl conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"6a842a3d-9add-46cc-8e6c-9693be896f10\" data-macro-name=\"code\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent pdl\">\n<pre class=\"syntaxhighlighter-pre\" data-syntaxhighlighter-params=\"brush: js; gutter: false; theme: Confluence\" data-theme=\"Confluence\">sections: {\n  &quot;observations&quot; : {\n    &quot;showDefault&quot;:false\n  },\n  &quot;disposition&quot;: null\t\n}</pre>\n</div></div></div></td><td colspan=\"1\" class=\"confluenceTd\"><ul><li>&quot;observations&quot;.&quot;name&quot; will not be modified</li><li>&quot;observations&quot;.&quot;showDefault&quot; will be overridden</li><li>&quot;disposition&quot; section will be REMOVED<br/><br/></li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><br/></p><hr/><p><br/></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27459635/overriding.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443103383669&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=541\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/27459635/overriding.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443103383669&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"29229105\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"overriding.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"27459635\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"15\" data-media-id=\"c324fbb6-c564-49a5-81a7-8b0b7912a660\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27459635/overriding.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443103383669&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=584&amp;height=633 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27459635/overriding.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443103383669&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=541 1x\"></span></p><p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" width=\"500\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/27459635/add.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1443112294201&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=500&amp;height=544\" data-image-sr